          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Fire Healing"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "As long as a crimson worm is in contact with a fire or body of magma at least as large as itself, it gains fast healing 20. When struck by a magical fire effect from anything other than itself, a crimson worm regains Hit Points equal to half the fire damage the effect would otherwise deal."
